00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:40.910
Shouldn't you start thinking about that now
for when you go back to your old school?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.780
I have to get back to work. Later!

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.070
Why?!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.140
I have nothing...

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.180
Is that a Shadow?

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.650
Everything is "nothing".

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.140
What's it doing here?

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.760
Friendship is an illusion.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:26.090
You are on your own. You are empty.

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.160
Persona!

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.160
M-my Arcana!

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:31.300
You have no bonds.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.630
Persona!
You have no bonds.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.300
You have nothing at all.

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:35.670
Persona!
You have nothing at all.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:36.660
You have nothing at all.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:39.610
You're just like me.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.680
Stop it...

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:44.800
You're wrong!

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:58.190
I can't... hang on...

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.800
Yu! Yu!

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:05.190
Give me your hand!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.870
That's right!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:10.730
I am...

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:12.800
Yu!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.310
YU!

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.850
Are you okay?

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.960
Thank you, Yosuke.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:37.430
Narukami!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.370
Senpai!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.800
Master, welcome back!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:40.930
Thank goodness you're okay.

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.170
Senpai, you all right?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:45.300
Yeah, now let's get him.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.730
Persona!

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.210
Burning
up!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.320
Not again!

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:08.160
You can't hit the Shadow
until you destroy its outer shell.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.780
Sweet! There he is!

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.650
He's rebuilding his defenses!

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.710
Oh, grizzly!
Damn it!

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.420
Not on my watch!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:38.660
Senpai, now's your chance!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.360
Go for it!

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.700
Please, Narukami!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.200
Hit him nice and hard!

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.800
You're up, Master!

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.430
I'll let you take the juicy scene!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:48.930
I...

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.900
...am not empty!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:55.710
Makami!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.740
King Frost!

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:10.620
High Pixie!

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.260
Pyro Jack!

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:26.870
Yamata-no-Orochi!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.810
How many Personas does he have?

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.040
Leanan Sidhe!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.190
Rakshasa!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:57.960
Ara Mitama!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:05.340
Izanagi!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.070
Who the hell are you guys?!

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.980
We're here to catch you.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:39.780
The police are after you for killing King Moron
on top of the other two murders.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:44.280
Are you the killer behind all these cases?

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.990
That's right! It was me!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:50.290
I killed them all! It was me!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.730
Huh? His Shadow vanished.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:18:59.930
What's going on?

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:03.770
He's gone... the bastard...

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.880
It's all over now.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:25.290
About Kubo...

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:29.090
I hear he confessed to everything,
so all the cases are officially closed.

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:33.300
When asked why he did it,
he said he wanted to stand out.

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:34.670
That's horrible!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:39.130
It's not like having a good reason
would make it better, but that's too much...

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.780
Let's leave the rest to the cops.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.080
Yeah, that's all we can do now.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:49.280
Our job here is done...

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.250
My world will be peaceful once more.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.820
We've sure been through a lot...

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:57.060
Like stud hunting. Bang!

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:59.130
Will you ever let that drop?

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.820
My Shadow did that, remember?

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:04.500
So like, what was it like for you, Yu?

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.100
Nothing happened.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.470
Really?

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.540
Master really is one of a kind.

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:15.210
Oh, yeah. I guess we're done
summoning our Personas, huh?

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:18.840
Do you think this will be our
last time meeting up like this?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.720
No, let's meet up again.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.750
You bet we will!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.820
It's summer break, so
it's only natural to hang out!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:30.720
We're already pals.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.690
Yay!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.990
Hey, let's hold a wrap party.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.960
Sounds good! We can
celebrate solving the cases.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.460
Let's go all-out and party!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.460
This is amazing!

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.470
Let's dig in!

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:47.040
Let's start with the one Yukiko made.

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:53.010
What gives? It tastes empty...

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:55.720
I feel like I bit into raw wheat gluten...

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:58.690
It-it's just too refined for you!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.090
Your rice omelet is good.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.550
Nanako...

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.550
Mine's up next.

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:07.250
W-well?

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.860
Yup, it's nasty.

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:10.560
It's good, too!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.390
Nanako!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.870
Oh, yeah, totally.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.730
This is definitely "nasty".

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.570
I thought you were gonna
defend me, not attack me!

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:21.470
Well, let's give Rise's a shot.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.340
I just know mine has hers beat.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.170
Yukiko!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:28.810
Down in one blow!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:32.290
It-it's too sophisticated for kids!

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.190
Honestly, you're a bunch of kids!

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.690
It's spicy, but it's still good.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.590
Nanako!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.600
In the end, yours was definitely the best.

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:50.740
You mean Big Bro's?

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:54.440
It's really good!

00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:56.680
I've never had a rice omelet like this before.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:22:00.920
They were all good, but I like Big Bro's the best.

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.510
Really? I'm glad.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:03.550
no time to waste

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.250
but make you pace

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:06.050
it's OK to remove copy and paste

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.020
I'm doing my way

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:07.920
you do it your way

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:09.560
don't just follow your left find the right way

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:10.330
stereotypes

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:11.190
too many hypes

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:13.030
but I'm the epitome of new types

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:14.700
having the fear is power to my soul

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:15.700
cuz I overcome them

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:16.400
that's how I roll

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:18.100
expose your thoughts

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:21.600
don't be afraid of making mistakes

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:24.130
rules prevailing in

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:28.810
that may be your greatest rival

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:33.750
believe in faith and your heart

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:36.880
your true soul stop being

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:39.490
in the shades come on

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:42.890
out in the open sun

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:48.930
Beauty of the child of destiny

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:52.370
delightful days

00:22:52.370 --> 00:22:57.440
are with rich density of love

00:22:57.440 --> 00:22:59.100
thorny path

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:04.300
there's no easy way for real bliss

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:07.480
so I keep on fighting for

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:12.250
beauty of destiny

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:21.260
It's about time I headed back to my side.

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:23.500
Are you going away somewhere?

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:25.800
Yeah, since they kept their promise.

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:30.030
Could you stay if you made a promise with me?

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.070
A promise with you?

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:35.530
Yep. Promise you'll come play with me!

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:37.600
Nana!

00:23:39.610 --> 00:23:46.220
Pinky promise! If I lie, stick
a thousand needles in my eye.

00:23:46.220 --> 00:23:48.050
It's a pinky promise!

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.150
Say, Yu?

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:53.800
You know how the shopping district
is holding a festival?

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.630
Whatcha say we all go together?

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:57.600
Sure, that sounds good, Yosuke.

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:01.560
You just called my big brother Yu!

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:05.910
What? What? What's going on?

00:24:05.910 --> 00:24:07.540
None of your business!

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:09.640
Come on, tell me!

00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:11.010
Give me some space!

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:12.510
But we're pals!

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:14.780
Don't use words you just learned!

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:19.650
Have you heard of New Feather Man?

00:24:19.650 --> 00:24:21.090
I'm trailing him.

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:23.020
Kuma got on a bus...

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:24.690
You got a girl?

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:26.520
She's got a kid?!

00:24:26.660 --> 00:24:27.830
Well, I'm off.

00:24:27.830 --> 00:24:30.390
I'm the mysterious detective, Loveline!
